183684 learned values/36 tensors,592 BN values/16 tensors;all warm before Adam(.0002).
| epoch | total | valid | hole | perceptual | style raw | style composite | TV | validation |
|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 1 | 352.843334 | 0.565205 | 0.168717 | 39.395426 | 2.031515 | 0.879039 | 0.296320 | 1180.692535 |
| 2 | 216.828444 | 0.501592 | 0.143128 | 31.065296 | 1.236919 | 0.545491 | 0.255808 | 539.202633 |
| 3 | 149.310572 | 0.438897 | 0.122286 | 25.825359 | 0.855100 | 0.368436 | 0.224104 | 357.555614 |
48 visible updates;selected epoch3,restored validation 357.555614;fixed fit total 544.770264->176.898010.
Image+mask-only deployment:checkpoint parity 0,single/batch max 2.07126141e-06,finite hidden-fill difference 0;repeat exact;all36 learned/16 BN tensors and all26 VGG tensors immutable,cached targets unchanged.
| estimate | hole MSE | mean hole PSNR dB | pooled hole PSNR dB | full PSNR dB | known max error |
